**Author verification:** the extracted program was run with Python 3.14.8. It agreed with independently recomputed prefix sums over 58,590 finite-grid cases; fourteen malformed-input cases, exact large integers, boundary examples, input preservation and fresh-process/working-directory repeatability also passed. These checks support this program and its stated examples; they do not prove every input or establish the truth of a real stock model.

